# LeakSanitizer suppressions for FastFiles tests.
#
# SDL_Init() pulls in video/dbus/drm one-time singletons that SDL_Quit()
# never frees (upstream behavior, not our allocations). Our own code has
# zero frames in those stacks; keep this file limited to third-party libs
# so real leaks in src/ still fail the tests.
#
# Wired via LSAN_OPTIONS in CMakeLists.txt (ctest). For manual runs:
#   LSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=$PWD/tests/lsan.supp ./build-san/test_app
leak:libSDL3
leak:libdbus
leak:libdrm
leak:drmGetDevices2
leak:dbus_bus_register
leak:_dbus_message_loader_queue_messages
